WEBVTT

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:37.454
Kanalis, I know you're not just
letting your position go to your head.

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:41.875
Working swiftly is your specialty,

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:45.545
but at times, it causes me displeasure.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:49.174
If you think I will not
kill you Heaven's Blades,

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:52.093
know that you are gravely mistaken.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.389
F-Forgive me...

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:05.982
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:09.569
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:17.285
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:22.874
<i>Roaming around the city having lost my map</i>

00:01:22.874 --> 00:01:26.211
<i>Even a dying world</i>

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:32.967
<i>Let me hear a life deep</i>
<i>within that won't stop running</i>

00:01:32.967 --> 00:01:35.970
<i>I seared the undying light into my eyes</i>

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:39.516
<i>Refusing to shut them</i>
<i>even when they dried</i>

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:46.231
<i>I don't believe anything I can</i>
<i>obtain without getting hurt</i>

00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:52.445
<i>A single emotion</i>
<i>directed toward someone</i>

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:59.703
<i>Splits the steel darkness</i>
<i>like the light of morning</i>

00:01:59.911 --> 00:02:04.332
<i>One day brave your</i>
<i>truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:04.332 --> 00:02:07.877
<i>So you will drastically change</i>

00:02:07.877 --> 00:02:13.675
<i>Compounded strength and prayers</i>

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:17.429
<i>Intersecting futures</i>
<i>and wishes held close</i>

00:02:17.429 --> 00:02:21.016
<i>I will give these to no one</i>

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:22.517
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:27.731
<i>It links our hearts</i>

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:33.194
Everyone, listen up.

00:02:33.194 --> 00:02:37.198
Our opponents in the next
competition will be the 1st,

00:02:37.198 --> 00:02:38.742
which is led by Vanzeh.

00:02:38.742 --> 00:02:43.580
Still, the 17th as it is now
does have a chance at victory.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:46.583
In preparation for the competition,

00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:48.793
I would like to hold a training camp.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:51.296
Where'd the cash for that come from?

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:55.508
My brother? No doubt he has
again attached an inappropriate condition.

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:59.262
No. This time, the student
council president is not involved.

00:02:59.262 --> 00:03:02.682
But you all have nothing
to worry about in regards to budget.

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:07.520
Well, brazenly cutting class makes <i>me </i>happy.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:11.399
Normally, I can't get enough
time to adjust the dites,

00:03:11.399 --> 00:03:13.401
so I'm all for it!

00:03:16.112 --> 00:03:17.739
As you wish.

00:03:20.158 --> 00:03:23.703
"Feelings That Are Not Received"

00:03:25.497 --> 00:03:27.957
Plant-area cleaning units...

00:03:27.957 --> 00:03:30.001
A section of the machinery department...

00:03:30.001 --> 00:03:33.254
There have been frequent reports recently

00:03:33.254 --> 00:03:35.632
of such problems across the city.

00:03:35.632 --> 00:03:37.717
Same goes for the people, no doubt.

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:40.053
They can only be worked
so hard before cracks start to appear.

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:44.432
If the problem were that simple,
I would not have called "Vanzeh-<i>kun</i>!";

00:03:44.432 --> 00:03:47.060
I'd have used this time
to scrape up the budget for it.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.520
Meaning what?

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:52.148
Something tells me
this is not simply deterioration.

00:03:52.816 --> 00:03:56.236
It is the will of the city,
run amok and causing ruin.

00:03:57.278 --> 00:04:00.198
You're saying this is because of the Fallen One?

00:04:00.198 --> 00:04:02.450
If it is, then we've taken on something

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:06.037
far more troublesome than I'd imagined.

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:33.606
It's big, isn't it?

00:04:33.982 --> 00:04:36.985
It's for students of the
Agriculture Department to do overnight stays.

00:04:36.985 --> 00:04:41.072
This is the area that
gives Zuellni its food supply.

00:04:41.072 --> 00:04:43.116
You took your time!

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:44.117
Mifi?

00:04:44.117 --> 00:04:46.995
Sorry. In exchange for paying for our lodgings,

00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:50.290
the condition was an article for Weekly Look'N.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:53.626
We're your sponsors! In exchange,

00:04:53.626 --> 00:04:56.129
you're going to give me a bunch of great shots!

00:04:56.129 --> 00:04:57.839
So that's what this is?

00:04:57.839 --> 00:04:59.007
Nice!

00:04:59.007 --> 00:05:01.426
Suddenly I'm starting to feel motivated!

00:05:02.177 --> 00:05:06.765
I understand regarding the article.
But why are <i>these </i>two here?

00:05:07.557 --> 00:05:13.188
We're your helpers.
We'll be handling the cooking and cleaning.

00:05:13.188 --> 00:05:15.023
We thank you.

00:05:21.488 --> 00:05:25.283
I am not pleased. It is too cramped.

00:05:26.284 --> 00:05:31.122
Restoration! Vween! Lay-ton,
reading enemy targets to your 6:00!

00:05:31.122 --> 00:05:36.920
Peel the potatoes until then!
Roger that, ma'am!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:39.339
--How silly.
--I'll help you.

00:05:40.048 --> 00:05:41.341
Lay-ton!

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:44.260
I'm free till this afternoon's training.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.887
Thank you.

00:05:51.393 --> 00:05:53.353
Say, where did the other two go?

00:05:53.353 --> 00:05:56.439
Mii-<i>chan </i>is getting ready for her article.

00:05:56.439 --> 00:06:00.694
Your platoon leader told Nakki
she wanted her help with the training...

00:06:00.694 --> 00:06:02.320
Restoration.

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:05.657
But this is a lot of work to do on your own.

00:06:05.657 --> 00:06:10.161
No, I like to cook. Also...

00:06:10.161 --> 00:06:11.955
This is the only thing I'm any good for.

00:06:11.955 --> 00:06:13.957
That's not true.

00:06:15.917 --> 00:06:17.877
I can't hear.

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:19.713
A little more...

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:26.052
At this rate, my only choice is to use nen'i.

00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:27.887
What are you doing?

00:06:27.887 --> 00:06:29.514
Ma'am!

00:06:34.477 --> 00:06:36.312
Perhaps we should help.

00:06:36.312 --> 00:06:37.814
Indeed.

00:06:37.814 --> 00:06:40.525
Have you ever cooked, ma'am?

00:06:40.525 --> 00:06:44.070
Why yes, I have! I once made
pancakes that made Harley

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:48.450
cry tears of joy while he ate them.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.785
And you?

00:06:50.785 --> 00:06:53.204
Of course I have.

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:03.048
What?!

00:07:03.048 --> 00:07:08.261
Oh, just thinkin' this is some
funny stuff you guys are doin'.

00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:10.221
Allow me to introduce what to the two of you

00:07:10.221 --> 00:07:14.100
will be the greatest possible item there is.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.186
This!

00:07:16.186 --> 00:07:17.270
What is it?

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:21.107
This baby will let you peel
the skins off of vegetables in no time!

00:07:21.107 --> 00:07:22.317
It's awesome.

00:07:22.317 --> 00:07:26.279
What?! Such a useful item exists?

00:07:26.279 --> 00:07:27.864
Would you kindly let go?

00:07:27.864 --> 00:07:30.492
No, you should leave this to me.

00:07:30.492 --> 00:07:32.369
Ma'am, I believe you would be better off

00:07:32.369 --> 00:07:34.662
planning today's training regimen.

00:07:34.662 --> 00:07:38.333
Why don't <i>you </i>give some
thought to your own training routine?

00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:40.710
There's no way I could
instruct a nen'i operator!

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:43.171
Not to worry, I have been doing that for years.

00:07:43.171 --> 00:07:45.215
I've got some ideas of my own, you know!

00:07:45.215 --> 00:07:47.217
What are you doing?

00:07:48.635 --> 00:07:51.096
You looked busy, so I thought I'd lend a hand!

00:07:51.096 --> 00:07:53.682
Oh, we've already finished with that.

00:07:54.391 --> 00:07:57.394
I'm going to go change before we eat.

00:08:04.651 --> 00:08:06.277
Restoration.

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:12.575
Sure enough, I think it's better
to use a configuration you're used to.

00:08:12.575 --> 00:08:14.285
A capture rope, eh?

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:19.457
Wow! The first and last
appearance of Nakki in the 17th, huh?

00:08:19.457 --> 00:08:23.461
I wouldn't be so sure.
These battle fatigues suit her.

00:08:23.461 --> 00:08:26.965
I wouldn't mind if she stayed here like this.

00:08:26.965 --> 00:08:29.884
I have my duties with
the municipal police force, so...

00:08:29.884 --> 00:08:31.511
Ah. I see.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:35.682
Let's train as if this were a competition.

00:08:35.682 --> 00:08:39.519
We can't do that with
this number of people, can we?

00:08:39.519 --> 00:08:43.023
That's easy. Layfon.

00:08:43.023 --> 00:08:44.941
You're on your own.

00:08:44.941 --> 00:08:46.443
Wait just a moment!

00:08:46.443 --> 00:08:49.821
You mean it's four against one? Eek!

00:08:49.821 --> 00:08:53.324
Well, give it a whirl. You'll see.

00:08:53.324 --> 00:08:55.160
Here we go.

00:08:58.038 --> 00:09:00.790
I'll head for the flag.
Naruki, you're the decoy,

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:03.960
and Sharnid, you slow him down.
Felli, you're supporting me.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:04.502
Are we good?

00:09:04.502 --> 00:09:05.211
Ma'am!

00:09:05.211 --> 00:09:06.838
Roger that!

00:09:19.017 --> 00:09:20.643
He's gone!

00:09:20.685 --> 00:09:22.812
He's approaching from 0400.

00:09:22.812 --> 00:09:24.439
From behind?!

00:09:25.482 --> 00:09:26.858
You don't have enough kei in your legs.

00:09:26.858 --> 00:09:28.485
He's so fast!

00:09:36.576 --> 00:09:38.578
That's... Layfon?!

00:09:53.093 --> 00:09:55.095
This time for sure!

00:10:19.953 --> 00:10:22.163
Layfon won, huh?

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:43.476
Sure enough, what my editor said was true.

00:10:43.476 --> 00:10:48.565
In Glendan, Lay-ton was one of
the "Keepers of the Heaven's Blades."

00:10:48.565 --> 00:10:52.277
If he's that powerful, why did he leave Glendan?

00:10:52.277 --> 00:10:55.071
That's the thing...

00:10:55.071 --> 00:10:58.491
Apparently he caused some
trouble and they made him leave.

00:10:58.491 --> 00:11:03.329
My boss told me to get
the dirt out of Lay-ton for this article.

00:11:04.164 --> 00:11:08.710
Otherwise, there's no reason for
Weekly Look'N to pay for our lodgings.

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:10.754
Does Senior Nina know?

00:11:10.754 --> 00:11:12.380
No way.

00:11:36.154 --> 00:11:39.115
What should I do, Your Majesty?

00:11:39.115 --> 00:11:42.577
I believe summoning the Fallen One
discovered in Zuellni to Glendan

00:11:42.577 --> 00:11:44.996
would be the best course...

00:11:45.789 --> 00:11:47.957
Are you listening, Your Majesty?

00:11:47.957 --> 00:11:49.542
Yeah, I'm listening.

00:11:49.542 --> 00:11:52.003
So long as there are
not twelve Heaven's Blades,

00:11:52.003 --> 00:11:54.714
that which can be obtained should be obtained.

00:11:54.714 --> 00:11:57.258
When Layfon first held
his Heaven's Blade, I thought

00:11:57.258 --> 00:12:00.762
"At last, I think he's come."

00:12:00.762 --> 00:12:04.224
I wonder if banishing him was a mistake.

00:12:04.224 --> 00:12:07.477
We must not remind
people that we military artists

00:12:07.477 --> 00:12:11.439
and nen'i operators are not human.

00:12:11.439 --> 00:12:15.193
No one can be allowed to truly realize that.

00:12:17.112 --> 00:12:20.865
Still, what happened
couldn't be helped, could it?

00:12:20.865 --> 00:12:23.660
Though it is sad for Leerin.

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:25.328
There is something I wish to report.

00:12:25.328 --> 00:12:27.163
What is it?

00:12:30.083 --> 00:12:31.626
What is this?

00:12:31.626 --> 00:12:36.506
Why did Glendan appear before that girl?

00:12:36.506 --> 00:12:38.508
I've always thought it strange.

00:12:52.063 --> 00:12:53.732
Because a contaminoid was there?

00:12:53.732 --> 00:12:56.234
But <i>you </i>were there, Majesty.

00:12:56.234 --> 00:13:01.364
You should have been able to defeat
the contaminoids before Glendan.

00:13:01.364 --> 00:13:07.954
Yet Glendan appeared before that girl.
As if to shield her.

00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:13.335
That's why I obtained
some of her hair, had it analyzed.

00:13:14.586 --> 00:13:16.588
She is you--

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:23.345
Kanalis, I know you're not just
letting your position go to your head.

00:13:23.345 --> 00:13:27.349
Working swiftly is your specialty,

00:13:27.349 --> 00:13:31.353
but at times, it causes me displeasure.

00:13:31.353 --> 00:13:35.023
If you think I will not
kill you Heaven's Blades,

00:13:35.023 --> 00:13:37.942
know that you are gravely mistaken.

00:13:39.069 --> 00:13:41.404
F-Forgive me...

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:49.621
There will not be a second time.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:58.672
It's delicious! This is so delicious!

00:13:58.672 --> 00:14:02.300
I've rarely eaten something so delicious!

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:04.302
Thank you, Mayshen!

00:14:05.762 --> 00:14:10.141
It is indeed delicious. It's very delicious.

00:14:10.141 --> 00:14:13.019
But I feel like I've tasted this before...

00:14:13.395 --> 00:14:15.230
Is that so?

00:14:17.565 --> 00:14:22.070
Oh! This is the same flavor
as the boxed lunches we always share!

00:14:22.779 --> 00:14:24.406
Huh?

00:14:28.451 --> 00:14:30.662
Wait, were those...?!

00:14:38.169 --> 00:14:39.796
Hey!

00:14:40.797 --> 00:14:42.674
For people like Layfon,
who can use different types of kei,

00:14:42.674 --> 00:14:45.301
--You come with me!
--something like an adamandite works best.

00:14:45.301 --> 00:14:46.511
How a dite is put together

00:14:46.511 --> 00:14:49.055
can change its properties and configuration.

00:14:49.055 --> 00:14:50.598
But if I try to make even a simple one,

00:14:50.598 --> 00:14:52.350
it ends up with nothing but bugs.

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:55.020
At least give it a rest while we're eatin'!

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:56.980
It's exactly this kind
of time that lets us talk!

00:14:56.980 --> 00:15:00.608
I swear! Of course you get a smack!

00:15:00.608 --> 00:15:03.361
How thick <i>are </i>you?!

00:15:03.361 --> 00:15:05.697
Didn't you think something was strange?

00:15:05.697 --> 00:15:09.034
There's a limit to just how
dense you can be! You're always...

00:15:12.954 --> 00:15:16.374
I wonder if Nina likes Lay-ton...

00:15:16.374 --> 00:15:18.168
What's this about?

00:15:18.168 --> 00:15:21.087
And what about Senior Felli?

00:15:21.087 --> 00:15:24.090
I wonder if May-cchi can win this...

00:15:26.176 --> 00:15:27.385
May.

00:15:27.385 --> 00:15:29.220
Where were you?

00:15:30.722 --> 00:15:32.932
I'm sorry. I'll help.

00:15:35.518 --> 00:15:37.145
This is bad.

00:15:41.316 --> 00:15:44.027
I have to apologize to Mayshen.

00:15:50.367 --> 00:15:54.079
Can you... not write that article?

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.540
That'd be impossible!

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.668
Today, when I fought Lay-ton...

00:15:59.668 --> 00:16:02.379
Honestly, I felt my chest tighten.

00:16:02.379 --> 00:16:07.217
I felt like each of his moves
held the experiences he's had up till now.

00:16:07.217 --> 00:16:08.718
Beautifully...

00:16:08.718 --> 00:16:10.970
Incredibly...

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:13.556
And... with sadness.

00:16:14.557 --> 00:16:19.479
Before, I wondered what kind
of past our flaky Lay-ton has had...

00:16:19.479 --> 00:16:21.690
All the more reason to wonder why Lay-ton,

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:24.943
who'd gotten as far as being a Heaven's Blade,

00:16:24.943 --> 00:16:29.030
had to leave Glendan, don't you think?

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:34.577
But that doesn't have to be put in
an article for everyone to see, does it?

00:16:34.577 --> 00:16:38.707
Sorry, Mii. I don't mean
to put your job in a bad light.

00:16:38.707 --> 00:16:41.835
I know what you're saying, Nakki.

00:16:41.835 --> 00:16:42.836
I...

00:16:44.254 --> 00:16:47.465
I want to know more about Lay-ton!

00:16:48.299 --> 00:16:50.135
Otherwise...

00:17:06.818 --> 00:17:08.653
What a handful...

00:17:12.657 --> 00:17:15.076
It's the Kolfe family attacking us!

00:17:17.495 --> 00:17:19.914
You know, this is the center of Hain City,

00:17:19.914 --> 00:17:22.709
and it is controlled by
one of the biggest families.

00:17:22.709 --> 00:17:26.463
A war here will destroy the Kolfes,
that's for sure.

00:17:26.463 --> 00:17:29.966
But by doing this, they must
believe they'll come out on top.

00:17:29.966 --> 00:17:32.260
Where's Gedosh? I wanna see him now!

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:35.263
You took the words right out of my mouth.

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:43.396
Coming in!

00:17:45.106 --> 00:17:50.362
I don't mind if you don't get up.
You'll just have to die in bed.

00:17:50.362 --> 00:17:52.155
Put some money in, dude.

00:17:52.155 --> 00:17:54.574
You haven't paid me back for last time yet.

00:17:54.574 --> 00:17:57.452
Reckon I wanna keep watchin'!
Put some money in!

00:18:06.461 --> 00:18:10.965
May-cchi and Lay-ton
live in all-too different worlds.

00:18:10.965 --> 00:18:12.175
If you look at it normally,

00:18:12.175 --> 00:18:15.303
May-cchi might not have a chance of winning...

00:18:15.303 --> 00:18:19.057
But Lay-ton is her first love.

00:18:19.057 --> 00:18:21.393
So I want to stand behind her.

00:18:21.393 --> 00:18:23.019
Yeah.

00:18:34.698 --> 00:18:36.533
I swear...

00:18:47.335 --> 00:18:49.170
Fon-Fon?

00:19:02.726 --> 00:19:04.602
Mayshen!

00:19:04.602 --> 00:19:08.815
Lay-ton! I'm sorry for calling you out here.

00:19:08.815 --> 00:19:12.652
No, I'm the one who
should be sorry, about the lunches.

00:19:12.652 --> 00:19:15.530
Nina yelled at me for being too dense...

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:20.035
No, I put them there
without even writing my name.

00:19:20.035 --> 00:19:23.913
I'll be sure to eat them from now on.

00:19:25.165 --> 00:19:29.419
Oh. "From now on"
sounds pretty presumptuous, huh?

00:19:29.419 --> 00:19:31.046
No...

00:19:33.923 --> 00:19:36.343
I...

00:19:36.343 --> 00:19:39.512
I want to know more about you, Lay-ton!

00:19:39.512 --> 00:19:43.641
Like why you left Glendan, and...

00:19:44.017 --> 00:19:46.978
You were a Keeper
of the Heaven's Blade, right?

00:19:46.978 --> 00:19:48.605
Yes.

00:19:52.025 --> 00:19:57.238
I left Glendan because I was
involved in underground tournaments.

00:19:57.238 --> 00:20:00.867
That's when the queen said to me:

00:20:00.867 --> 00:20:04.537
"We must not remind
people that we military artists

00:20:04.537 --> 00:20:07.707
and nen'i operators are not human."

00:20:08.124 --> 00:20:11.127
I didn't understand it at the time, but...

00:20:15.465 --> 00:20:18.927
Heaven's Blades are like monsters,
able to use kei

00:20:18.927 --> 00:20:22.138
to a much greater degree
than other military artists.

00:20:22.138 --> 00:20:25.308
And I, one of the monsters,
acted outside the laws of military artists

00:20:25.308 --> 00:20:27.143
without batting an eye.

00:20:27.143 --> 00:20:31.690
If everyone knew that, there'd be panic.

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:36.069
That's why the queen
banished me from Glendan.

00:20:36.903 --> 00:20:40.240
It was the queen's mercy that I wasn't executed.

00:20:41.491 --> 00:20:46.996
I'm a monster. So there's
nothing wrong with being afraid of me.

00:21:00.802 --> 00:21:02.637
I'm not afraid!

00:21:15.525 --> 00:21:17.152
Restoration!

00:21:32.334 --> 00:21:33.960
Hold on...

00:21:36.796 --> 00:21:38.423
Lay-ton!

00:21:50.435 --> 00:21:53.063
Lay-ton...

00:21:55.357 --> 00:21:57.192
I'm all right.

00:21:58.651 --> 00:22:01.404
No, you're not all right!

00:22:01.404 --> 00:22:04.449
I'm glad... you found me.

00:22:04.449 --> 00:22:08.119
Of course! Our leader
and the others will be here soon.

00:22:08.119 --> 00:22:11.081
Please don't move.

00:22:11.081 --> 00:22:13.291
Thank you, Felli.

00:22:14.876 --> 00:22:17.879
Lay-ton! Lay-ton!

00:22:26.262 --> 00:22:36.356
<i>Hello, who are you thinking of?</i>

00:22:36.356 --> 00:22:43.446
<i>This letter still lies within my breast</i>

00:22:43.446 --> 00:22:53.498
<i>That fragment of memories</i>
<i>of you, suddenly encountered,</i>

00:22:53.498 --> 00:23:00.588
<i>has pierced my heart and I can't move</i>

00:23:00.588 --> 00:23:05.427
<i>I want you to notice, don't notice</i>

00:23:05.427 --> 00:23:09.139
<i>Do you treat me coldly because of love?</i>

00:23:09.139 --> 00:23:18.732
<i>I want to tell you "Be by my side," </i>
<i>but I can't say it</i>

00:23:19.524 --> 00:23:28.116
<i>It was in this filthy world</i>
<i>that I was able to meet you</i>

00:23:28.116 --> 00:23:39.294
<i>Please play this miracle</i>
<i>that has descended to my heart</i>

00:23:39.294 --> 00:23:47.302
<i>Zuellni my love</i>

00:23:53.725 --> 00:23:55.101
<i>With Layfon still absent,</i>

00:23:55.101 --> 00:23:58.772
<i>the 17th Platoon challenges</i>
<i>the 1st Platoon in competition.</i>

00:23:58.772 --> 00:24:00.607
<i>Layfon, his wounds still not healed,</i>

00:24:00.607 --> 00:24:03.276
<i>is given a secret assignment by Kalian...</i>

00:24:03.276 --> 00:24:06.446
<i>Next time, "Zuellni Run Amok</i>
<i>and the Contaminoid Offensive!" and...</i>

00:24:06.446 --> 00:24:08.128
<i>Restoration!</i>
